      "jp": "式神と人心を操り、島を荒している雉――ナキメ。\nその討伐を依頼された主人公は、声を追って東の村に辿り着いた。",
      "jp_sha256": "27d17d783d076eba9aa55e8f0f7f3c2e2db26128f14c4798b71acfec3fbf4363",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "식신과 사람의 마음을 조종하며 섬을 어지럽힌다는 꿩―― 나키메.\n그 토벌을 의뢰받은 주인공은 소리를 쫓아 동쪽 마을에 도착했다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "727cd0465fcdf8e1541964e6af64472b7f98afa08ebc2d3905e526637cff7394:000002_1352948697319796123:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "式神と人心を操り、島を荒している雉――ナキメ。\nその討伐を依頼された主人公は、声を追って東の村に辿り着いた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "0b3d3f10a82b14c3615634036dcbd654b70ff1f3acbd4062a0ea1cfcaa632016",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "村に着きましたが、ナキメの姿はないようですね。\n荒された様子もないですし……隠れているのでしょうか？",
      "jp_sha256": "746672d97d4afc3bdd402fbd61d79cc2197bf951a26de382fa5eb1160293632f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "마을에 도착했지만 나키메의 모습은 보이지 않는군요.\n어지럽혀진 흔적도 없고…… 숨어 있는 걸까요?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "727cd0465fcdf8e1541964e6af64472b7f98afa08ebc2d3905e526637cff7394:000002_1352948697319796123:g0:r9",
      "row_index_0based": 9,
      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ビビ神",
        "Emt2_Ang",
        "layer_ビビ神c_左",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "村に着きましたが、ナキメの姿はないようですね。\n荒された様子もないですし……隠れているのでしょうか？",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ビビ神",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "3885c1aff7576a779da8275b5927f1f3ccb75e28ecae0debe0a5959449bd1f70",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あそこに――誰かいるぞ。\nキジを見ていないか――聞いてみないか――？",
      "jp_sha256": "05b49fc44172371f18055143b2fbf49e8df27db0ac8d6a240adcc777357902a4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "저기에―― 누군가 있다.\n꿩을 보지 못했는지―― 물어보는 게―― 어떻겠나――?",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "727cd0465fcdf8e1541964e6af64472b7f98afa08ebc2d3905e526637cff7394:000002_1352948697319796123:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "シルバ牛頭鬼",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_右中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "あそこに――誰かいるぞ。\nキジを見ていないか――聞いてみないか――？",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "シルバ牛頭鬼",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d5a15045cf72c0214d52182d9a9a2bed5e0b93ce6bd90a0db532cbd3ce1cc031",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そうですね。\nあの、すみません。ちょっとお尋ねしたいことが――。",
      "jp_sha256": "c3078980d29501958bc1efd3d6c8bf4699535001d4ba626de48f3a82a5bbefb2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그렇네요.\n저기, 실례합니다. 좀 여쭤보고 싶은 게――.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "727cd0465fcdf8e1541964e6af64472b7f98afa08ebc2d3905e526637cff7394:000002_1352948697319796123:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そうですね。\nあの、すみません。ちょっとお尋ねしたいことが――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
