      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "薄幸そうな美女は主人公をギュっと抱きしめた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
